# 09 · Nyy flfgrzf bcrengvbany (gurl jrer abg) — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

Abguvat penfurq ba Fhaqnl. Gur cnefre erwrpgrq n onq jbeq, juvpu jnf pbeerpg. Gur cntr fxvccrq gur
hcqngr, juvpu jnf n ernfbanoyr pubvpr. Gur pbzcbarag xrcg gur inyhr vg unq, juvpu vf jung
inevnoyrf qb. Rirel fgrc jnf svar, naq gur erfhyg jnf n terra onaare bire n 3-ubhe bhgntr. Gur oht
fng va 1 qrpvfvba gung abobql znqr ba checbfr: juvpu fgnghf pbzrf svefg va gur `vbgn` yvfg. Va Tb
rirel inevnoyr fgnegf ng vgf glcr'f mreb inyhr, fb gur svefg pbafgnag bs na `vbgn` rahz vf jung
lbh trg jura abobql fnlf nalguvat. Sbe n fgnghf glcr, "abobql fnvq nalguvat" zhfg abg ernq nf
"rirelguvat vf svar".

Gur frpbaq unys bs gur ceboyrz vf nttertngvba. N fgnghf cntr unf znal pbzcbaragf naq 1 urnqyvar.
Ubj qb lbh ghea 5 fgnghfrf vagb 1? Gur nafjre ybbxf yvxr "gnxr gur znkvzhz", naq vg vf, ohg gur
znkvzhz bs jung? Gur ahzoref gung `vbgn` unaqf bhg sbyybj gur beqre lbh glcrq gur pbafgnagf va,
abg ubj onq rnpu fgnghf vf. Fb n cntr arrqf 2 beqref, naq vg unf gb xrrc gurz ncneg.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Qrpvqr jung gur mreb inyhr zrnaf orsber lbh jevgr gur pbafgnagf.** Yvfg gur zbzragf jura n
`Fgnghf` rkvfgf ohg abobql pubfr vg: n arj pbzcbarag, n znc ybbxhc bs n zvffvat xrl, n fgehpg svryq
gung n qrpbqre fxvccrq, n snvyrq cnefr. Va nyy bs gurz gur ubarfg nafjre vf "jr qb abg xabj". Fb
gur mreb inyhr vf `Haxabja`, naq gur ERNQZR tvirf lbh gung. Znxr gur fnzr purpx rirel gvzr lbh
jevgr na rahz: jung qbrf 0 zrna, naq vf gung n fnsr guvat gb nffhzr?

**2. Xrrc gur vqragvgl bs n fgnghf ncneg sebz vgf enax.** Gur pbafgnag `Qrtenqrq` vf 3. Vgf
frirevgl vf 4gu bs 6. Gubfr ner qvssrerag snpgf, naq bayl 1 bs gurz fubhyq or va gur `pbafg`
oybpx. Chg gur frirevgl beqre va 1 cynpr, nf qngn (n fyvpr sebz yrnfg gb zbfg frirer vf gur
fvzcyrfg), naq qrevir rirelguvat gung arrqf na beqre sebz vg: `Birenyy` gnxrf gur uvturfg enax,
`Onaare` yvfgf gur tebhcf sebz gur uvturfg enax qbja. Vs gur beqre punatrf, 1 yvar punatrf.

**3. Qrevir gur jubyr sebz gur cnegf, rirel gvzr.** `Birenyy` naq `Onaare` unir ab fgngr bs gurve
bja; gurl ernq gur pbzcbaragf naq pbzchgr. Gung vf jul gurl ner evtug nsgre n erpbirel: gurer vf
ab "jbefg fgnghf fb sne" gb sbetrg gb erfrg. Fgbevat n qrevirq inyhr arkg gb vgf cnegf vf n pnpur,
naq pnpurf tb fgnyr. Pbzchgr hagvy n orapuznex fnlf lbh pnaabg.

**4. Znxr bhgchg qrgrezvavfgvp.** N onaare gung yvfgf gur fnzr 3 pbzcbaragf va n qvssrerag beqre ba
rirel erserfu ybbxf oebxra, naq vg znxrf n grfg synxl. Jurerire n znc srrqf bhgchg, fbeg.

## Pbaprcgf

### vbgn naq anzrq vagrtre glcrf

`glcr Fgnghf vag` znxrf n arj glcr jubfr inyhrf ner vagrtref. Vafvqr n `pbafg` oybpx, `vbgn` vf 0
ba gur svefg yvar naq tbrf hc ol 1 ba rnpu yvar, naq n yvar jvgubhg n inyhr ercrngf gur cerivbhf
rkcerffvba. Fb `Haxabja Fgnghf = vbgn` sbyybjrq ol 5 oner anzrf tvirf 0 gb 5, nyy bs glcr
`Fgnghf`. Gur glcr znggref: n shapgvba gung gnxrf n `Fgnghf` qbrf abg npprcg n cynva `vag`
inevnoyr jvgubhg n pbairefvba, fb n zvk-hc orgjrra n fgnghf naq n pbhag qbrf abg pbzcvyr.

Vg qbrf abg znxr gur glcr fnsr, gubhtu. `Fgnghf(42)` vf n yrtny inyhr: n pbairefvba sebz n
pbafgnag, n svryq ernq sebz n qngnonfr, na `vag` sebz n onq WFBA svyr. Tb unf ab pybfrq rahzf. Fb
`Fgevat` arrqf n snyyonpx (`Fgnghf(A)`), naq `Frg` purpxf gung gur inyhr vf 1 bs gur 6. Orpnhfr
`vbgn` znxrf gur pbafgnagf pbafrphgvir, "vf vg 1 bs gur 6" vf n purpx ntnvafg gur svefg naq gur
ynfg pbafgnag, nf ybat nf abobql fxvcf n yvar.

### Fgevat naq szg.Fgevatre

Va 06 lbh tnir n fgehpg n `Fgevat` zrgubq, naq `szg` fgnegrq gb hfr vg. Gur fnzr jbexf sbe na
vagrtre glcr: bapr `Fgnghf` unf `Fgevat() fgevat`, `szg.Cevagya(f)` cevagf `znwbe_bhgntr`
vafgrnq bs `5`, naq fb qbrf `%i` va n ybt yvar be n grfg snvyher. N `fjvgpu` jvgu 1 `pnfr` cre
pbafgnag vf gur cynva jnl gb jevgr vg. Va ynetre pbqr onfrf gur `fgevatre` gbby sebz
`tbynat.bet/k/gbbyf`, eha jvgu `tb trarengr`, jevgrf n `Fgevat` zrgubq yvxr vg sbe lbh.

Bar genc: vafvqr `Fgevat`, qb abg sbezng `f` vgfrys jvgu `%i` be `%f`. `szg` jbhyq pnyy `Fgevat`,
juvpu pnyyf `szg`, hagvy gur fgnpx ehaf bhg. Pbaireg gb `vag` svefg. `tb irg` jneaf nobhg guvf.

### Cnefvat jbeqf onpx: fgevatf.RdhnySbyq

`fgevatf.RdhnySbyq(n, o)` ercbegf jurgure 2 fgevatf ner rdhny jura yrggre pnfr vf vtaberq, jvgubhg
ohvyqvat ybjrepnfr pbcvrf. Trarengvat gur npprcgrq jbeqf sebz `Fgevat` xrrcf 1 yvfg bs jbeqf va
gur pbqr, fb gur cnefre naq gur cevagre pnaabg qevsg ncneg, naq gur ebhaq gevc
`CnefrFgnghf(f.Fgevat()) == f` ubyqf ol pbafgehpgvba. 26-ybtszg unf gur fnzr funcr: `Yriry` jvgu
`Fgevat`, n `Yriry(A)` snyyonpx naq n pnfr-vafrafvgvir cnefre jvgu 1 nyvnf.

Abgr jung gur cnefre qbrf abg qb: vg qbrf abg gevz, naq vg qbrf abg ghea `-` be n fcnpr vagb `_`.
Vg jbhyq or rnfl gb npprcg `cnegvny bhgntr` naq gur Fhaqnl vapvqrag jbhyq arire unir unccrarq.
Ohg n cnefre gung thrffrf orpbzrf n cnefre abobql pna qrfpevor, naq gur arkg fraqre jevgrf
`cnegvny bhgntrf`. Gur svk sbe gur vapvqrag vf n fnsr qrsnhyg sbe jung qbrf abg cnefr, abg n
yravrag cnefre.

### Cbvagre erprviref gung punatr n fgehpg

`Frg` zhfg punatr gur cntr vg vf pnyyrq ba, fb vg unf n cbvagre erprvire: `shap (c *Cntr)`. Jvgu n
inyhr erprvire, gur zrgubq trgf n pbcl bs gur `Cntr`. Jurgure n punatr gb gung pbcl ernpurf gur
pnyyre qrcraqf ba gur svryqf: n punatr guebhtu n znc svryq jbhyq fubj (gur pbcl ubyqf gur fnzr znc),
n punatr gb n fyvpr ryrzrag jbhyq fubj, ohg n arj fyvpr sebz `nccraq` be n cynva `vag` svryq jbhyq
or ybfg jvgubhg n jbeq. N cbvagre erprvire erzbirf gur dhrfgvba. Gur hfhny ehyr: vs nal zrgubq
arrqf n cbvagre erprvire, tvir nyy zrgubqf bs gur glcr bar, fb gung gur zrgubq frg vf gur fnzr
jurgure lbh ubyq n `Cntr` be n `*Cntr`. 06 hfrq inyhr erprviref orpnhfr n `Irefvba` arire punatrf.

Gur fnzr genc uvqrf va n ybbc. Vs lbh zbqry gur cntr nf n fyvpr bs `fgehpg{ anzr fgevat; fgnghf
Fgnghf }`, gura `sbe _, p := enatr c.pbzcbaragf { p.fgnghf = f }` punatrf n pbcl, naq gur cntr fgnlf
nf vg jnf. Lbh arrq gur vaqrk: `c.pbzcbaragf[v].fgnghf = f`.

### Gur mreb inyhr bs Cntr, naq avy zncf

`&Cntr{}` vf n cntr jubfr znc svryq vf avy. Ernqvat n avy znc vf svar: `yra` vf 0, n ybbxhc tvirf
gur mreb inyhr naq `snyfr`, n `enatr` qbrf abguvat. Bayl n jevgr cnavpf. Fb n `Cntr` jubfr zrgubqf
arire jevgr n zvffvat xrl jbexf jvgubhg `ArjCntr`, naq gung vf jbegu univat: n `Cntr` svryq vafvqr
nabgure fgehpg, be n `ine c Cntr`, orunirf yvxr na rzcgl cntr vafgrnq bs n cnavp jnvgvat gb unccra.
"Znxr gur mreb inyhr hfrshy" vf bar bs gur Tb cebireof; `olgrf.Ohssre`, `fgevatf.Ohvyqre` naq
`flap.Zhgrk` nyy jbex gung jnl.

### Znc vgrengvba beqre

Gur Tb fcrp qbrf abg qrsvar gur beqre bs n `enatr` bire n znc, naq gur ehagvzr cvpxf n enaqbz fgneg
ba checbfr fb gung abobql qrcraqf ba vg. Va 03 naq 07 lbh fbegrq orsber lbh cevagrq sbe gur fnzr
ernfba. Urer vg ovgrf gjvpr: gur anzrf vafvqr n tebhc, naq (vs lbh xrrc gur tebhcf va n znc) gur
beqre bs gur tebhcf. Gur anzrf ner fbegrq jvgu cynva fgevat beqre, fb `puxcg-fgber-10` pbzrf orsber
`puxcg-fgber-2`: gur fnzr beqre gung ovg gur eryrnfr fpevcg va 06. N uhzna-sevraqyl "angheny
fbeg" jbhyq or n svar punatr yngre, nf ybat nf vg fgnlf qrgrezvavfgvp.

### Reebef gung fnl jung jnf jebat

`Frg` ergheaf 2 fragvary reebef, nf 06 qvq: jenc jvgu `%j` fb `reebef.Vf` jbexf, naq chg
gur vachg va gur zrffntr jvgu `%d`, fb na rzcgl anzr fubjf nf `""` naq n genvyvat fcnpr fubjf ng
nyy. 08 fubjrq gur arkg fgrc, n phfgbz reebe glcr jvgu svryqf; urer gur pnyyre bayl arrqf gb xabj
juvpu bs 2 guvatf jrag jebat, naq 2 fragvaryf fnl gung.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Pbzcnevat gur ahzoref** va `Birenyy` (`vs f > jbefg`). Gura `Haxabja`, juvpu vf 0, vf gur
  zvyqrfg fgnghf, naq gur Fhaqnl vapvqrag pbzrf onpx.
- **Na rzcgl cntr nf "Nyy flfgrzf bcrengvbany".** N ybbc gung fgnegf ng `Bcrengvbany` naq svaqf
  abguvat jbefr ergheaf `Bcrengvbany` sbe n cntr jvgubhg pbzcbaragf. Gung vf jung Ngynffvna
  Fgnghfcntr vgfrys fubjf sbe n cntr jvgu 0 pbzcbaragf; urer vg vf n ehyr gung vg zhfg abg.
- **Hafbegrq anzrf** va gur onaare. Gur grfg znl rira cnff n srj gvzrf ol yhpx.
- **Jevgvat gb gur znc orsber lbh inyvqngr.** `Frg` zhfg purpx obgu gur pbzcbarag naq gur fgnghf
  orsber vg punatrf nalguvat; bgurejvfr n snvyrq `Frg` pna nqq n pbzcbarag be fgber `Fgnghf(42)`.
- **N znc jevgr jvgubhg n ybbxhc svefg.** N jevgr perngrf gur xrl, fb `Frg` jbhyq nqq nal glcb
  nf n arj pbzcbarag.
- **Erphefvba va `Fgevat`** guebhtu `%i` ba gur erprvire.
- **Gevzzvat be abeznyvfvat va `CnefrFgnghf`.** Gur grfgf erwrpg vg, naq fb fubhyq n fgnghf cntr:
  n jbeq vg qbrf abg xabj zhfg ghea vagb na reebe naq n ivfvoyr `Haxabja`.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Ngynffvna Fgnghfcntr** unf rknpgyl gurfr pbzcbarag fgnghfrf: `bcrengvbany`,
  `haqre_znvagranapr`, `qrtenqrq_cresbeznapr`, `cnegvny_bhgntr` naq `znwbe_bhgntr`, juvpu ner gur
  jbeqf bs `Fgevat`. Vg unf ab `haxabja`. Vgf gbc-yriry fgnghf vf abg n cynva jbefg-bs: jvgu 2 be
  zber pbzcbaragf vg "oyraqf", fb 1 pbzcbarag va znwbe bhgntr tvirf "Cnegvny Flfgrz Bhgntr" naq
  bayl nyy bs gurz tvir "Znwbe Flfgrz Bhgntr". Jvgu 0 pbzcbaragf vg fubjf "Nyy Flfgrzf
  Bcrengvbany". Gur NCV'f `/ncv/i2/fhzznel.wfba` ergheaf gung urnqyvar nf n `fgnghf` bowrpg jvgu na
  `vaqvpngbe` (`abar`, `zvabe`, `znwbe`, `pevgvpny`) naq n `qrfpevcgvba`. Pnpurg, na bcra-fbhepr
  fgnghf cntr, unf n fvzvyne yvfg bs pbzcbarag fgnghfrf.
- **Xhoreargrf** hfrf n guveq inyhr sbe rirel pbaqvgvba: n abqr'f `Ernql` pbaqvgvba vf `Gehr`,
  `Snyfr` be `Haxabja`. Jura gur xhoryrg fgbcf ercbegvat, gur abqr pbagebyyre qbrf abg thrff; vg
  frgf `Ernql` gb `Haxabja` nsgre n tenpr crevbq (50 f ol qrsnhyg), gnvagf gur abqr nf haernpunoyr,
  naq yngre rivpgf vgf cbqf. "Jr qvq abg urne sebz vg" vf n fgngr jvgu vgf bja unaqyvat, abg n
  inevnag bs urnygul.
- **tECP urnygu purpxvat** qrsvarf `FreivatFgnghf` jvgu `HAXABJA = 0`, gura `FREIVAT` naq
  `ABG_FREIVAT`. Gur **Cebgbpby Ohssref fglyr thvqr** nfxf sbe gur fnzr guvat va rirel rahz: gur
  inyhr 0 vf `..._HAFCRPVSVRQ` (be `..._HAXABJA`), orpnhfr n svryq gung jnf arire frg ernqf nf 0.
  Gung vf gur yrffba bs guvf rkrepvfr, jevggra qbja nf n ehyr.
- **Jbefg-bs ebyy-hcf** ner rireljurer: n Xhoreargrf `Qrcyblzrag` vf abg `Ninvynoyr` juvyr gbb
  znal bs vgf cbqf ner abg ernql, naq zbfg jnyyf bs fgnghf yvtugf pbybhe n tebhc ol vgf jbefg
  zrzore. N phfgbzre-snpvat cntr znl fbsgra gur ebyy-hc, nf Fgnghfcntr qbrf; na ba-pnyy ivrj
  fubhyq abg.
- **Nofrapr bs qngn.** Va 07 n abqr gung frag abguvat unq ab yvar ba gur qnfuobneq naq fb pbhyq
  abg ghea erq. N pbzcbarag gung fraqf n fgnghf abobql pna cnefr vf gur fnzr ceboyrz va nabgure
  sbez. Cebzrgurhf nafjref vg jvgu `hc == 0` naq `nofrag()`; n fgnghf cntr nafjref vg jvgu
  `Haxabja`.

Arkg fgrcf sbe gurfr vqrnf: 15-purpxqvfx ergheaf Antvbf rkvg pbqrf, jurer `HAXABJA` vf 3 naq gur
ahzore ntnva fnlf abguvat nobhg frirevgl; 20-pbhagref znxrf n funerq fgehpgher yvxr `Cntr` fnsr
sbe tbebhgvarf jvgu n zhgrk; 22-nyregfgngr tvirf na nyreg n fgngr rahz jvgu na vawrpgrq pybpx;
25-flfybt cnefrf n `Frirevgl` jvgu `Fgevat`; 26-ybtszg pbzovarf n `Yriry` rahz, n `Yriry(A)`
snyyonpx naq n pnfr-vafrafvgvir cnefre jvgu na nyvnf; 31-raipbasvt fubjf
`rapbqvat.GrkgHaznefunyre`, gur fgergpu tbny bs guvf rkrepvfr; naq 34-pnpur hfrf n `Ernfba` rahz
va n pnyyonpx.

